A Zemaphore is kind of like an inverted semaphore; it just counts the other direction. Hence, to provide mutex, just init to -1 instead of 1 (as we would with a binary semaphore.) 
Zemaphore w; 
Zemaphore _Init(&w, -1); // init to -1

Zemaphore _One(&w); 
….//CS
Zemaphore _Done(&w);
